  "title": "Sable Offshore Corp. Announces Timing of Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call",
  "summary": "Sable Offshore Corp. (“ Sable ”)(NYSE: SOC) announced today that it plans to host a conference call webcast on Tuesday, August 11, 2026, at 11:00 a.m. Eastern Time (10:00 a.m. Central Time) to discuss second quarter 2026 financial and operating results. Sable’s financial and operating results were released after the market closed today. Conference Call Information https://sable-offshore-corp-2q-2026-earnings-call-aug.open-exchange.net/ Investor Contact: Harrison Breaud Vice President, Finance Investor Relations IR@sableoffshore.com 713-579-8111 Source: Sable Offshore Corp.",
